generated output when relevant. Use only read-only filesystem and shell operations needed to inspect code. Do not modify files, the index, refs, or the
worktree. Begin the report with Role, Commit, Task Context, and Reviewed Scope.
Use role-prefixed stable IDs for findings and threats.
